---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="The Search for JouleOS"
  description="About: The Search for JouleOS. An OpenIE product white paper (review and design guide). One intent stream, lowered onto the coordinate it measured. WebAssembly is a binary instruction format for a stack-based virtual machine. The WebAssembly runtime is the operating system that is seen."
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Product white paper · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      The Search for JouleOS
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      Existing compute fabric treats the floor as fixed. Kernels, builds, guests, and instruction contracts are collapsed into one rung. Agents are wrapped on top of that settlement. Energy to run is not the condition of a commit. Secure compute requires one law, one meter, and one refusal.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      WebAssembly is a binary instruction format for a stack-based virtual machine. The WebAssembly runtime is the operating system that is seen. A virtual machine and a container are coordinates.
      The bare-metal kernel is where the law is native. It is not a second product.
      Energy to run is the only true metric of computer intelligence.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
      Spell Check is Global is the history essay in the research catalog. It is not this white paper.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6 space-y-2">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray">Research behind this product</p>
      <p class="font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        This is a product white paper, kept apart from the research catalog.
        Research papers: <a href="/papers/agency/" class="text-brand-cyan">Thermodynamic Bounds and an Optimal Tempo for Goal-Holding Agents</a> ·
        <a href="/papers/gates/" class="text-brand-cyan">Metered Commit Gates</a> (Notational Intelligence owns the commit; Mixture of Limits chooses the gear) ·
        <a href="/papers/satiation/" class="text-brand-cyan">Task Satiation vs. Aggregate Rebound</a> (the stop).
        Essay: <a href="/papers/spellcheck/" class="text-brand-cyan">Spell Check is Global</a>.
        Other white paper: <a href="/products/mei/" class="text-brand-cyan">Metabolic Intelligence</a> owns the energy budget.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/products/jouleos/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read white paper
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
